cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata in this file."

title: "GeoAI-UrbanTree-RFDETR"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Liao"
    given-names: "Hao-Yu"

abstract: >
  Reproducible RF-DETR pipeline for urban tree detection from
  high-resolution geospatial imagery, supporting GeoTIFF and vector-label
  preparation to COCO format, train/validation/test experiments,
  cross-validation, transfer evaluation, and large-area geospatial inference.

keywords:
  - GeoAI
  - urban trees
  - RF-DETR
  - object detection
  - remote sensing
  - geospatial artificial intelligence
  - NAIP
  - cross-validation
  - transfer learning
  - geospatial inference

repository-code: "https://github.com/GeoAI-Earth-eXplore/GeoAI-UrbanTree-RFDETR"

license: MIT

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: 2026-09-28
